@url = http://localhost:5080
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@integrationKey = REPLACE_WITH_VALUE_FROM_ENV

### Health
GET {{url}}/health

### Integration adapter: canonical JSON, NOT original FormDesigner field names
POST {{url}}/api/integrations/formdesigner/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Integration-Key: {{integrationKey}}

{
  "externalSubmissionId": "test-001",
  "gameSessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "teamName": "Команда Звук",
  "customerName": "Тестовый клиент",
  "phone": "+70000000000",
  "telegram": "test_example",
  "quantity": 2
}
